     identity.j2 — the ONE identity block, included by the EN and RO cover letters
     and by the platform packs. Changing a contact detail here changes it on every
     surface at once, which is the point: a mismatch between two documents from the
     same person is itself a credibility cost.

     City and country only. No street address, no date of birth, no nationality,
     no photo — on any surface, in any language.
---------------------------------------------------------------------------- -#}
